esh after a horrible middle school relationship? Nope! Not unless your ex ends up at the same school as you and is now your stepsibling. What was supposed to be a sanctuary of peace where I could avoid ever seeing her again has become a living nightmare! Everywhere I look, I see her—in my house, in my school, in my class. There's no escape! She even claims that she’s the older sibling. Like hell she is! But I won't lose to her. After all, I'm the older brother in this new family situation. That’s right, we’re family now. No matter how much we may have thought we loved each other before, we saw one another’s true colors and realized we weren’t meant for each other. That’s why even though we may keep up a buddy-buddy sibling act for the sake of our parents, things will never go back to the way they used to be.\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)"},"tags":[{"name":"Inseki","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cohabitation","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":62,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Feet","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":54,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":51,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"My Stepmom's Daughter is My Ex","english":"My Stepmom's Daughter is My Ex","native":"継母の連れ子が元カノだった","romaji":"Mamahaha no Tsurego ga Motokano datta","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"继母的拖油瓶是我的前女友"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Tsurekano"}]},"trailer":{"id":"lGLnp30CHCc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lGLnp30CHCc/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}